102","armor":"WP1007505","helmet":"WP1021305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,80,56,42,78,89],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"98","reputation":"4600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006102","armor":"WP1007505","helmet":"WP1021305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,80,56,42,78,89],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"98","reputation":"4600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006102","armor":"WP1007505","helmet":"WP1021305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,80,56,42,78,89],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"98","reputation":"4600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006102","armor":"WP1007505","helmet":"WP1021305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,80,56,42,78,89],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"98","reputation":"4600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006102","armor":"WP1007505","helmet":"WP1021305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1035","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,80,56,42,78,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006102","armor":"WP1007505","helmet":"WP1021305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10011","city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,80,56,42,78,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"110","reputation":"2700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006102","armor":"WP1007505","helmet":"WP1021305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀汉中期将领。傅彤早年追随刘备入蜀，在平定益州过程中屡立战功，逐渐晋升为中级军官。章武二年（222年），傅彤随刘备东征孙吴，担任前锋部队将领。在猇亭之战中率部突入吴军阵地，多次击退吴军反扑，展现卓越勇武。夷陵之战刘备惨败，陆逊火攻连营。傅彤临危受命，率残部断后阻击追兵，在烈火中死战不退。身被数创，仍大呼酣战，为刘备撤退赢得宝贵时间。吴军劝降时，傅彤厉声斥责：“吴狗！何有汉将军降者！” 最终力竭战死。其子傅佥后来亦在蜀汉灭亡时于关城殉国。","tc":"蜀漢中期將領。傅彤早年追隨劉備入蜀，在平定益州過程中屢立戰功，逐漸晉升為中級軍官。章武二年（222年），傅彤隨劉備東征孫吳，擔任前鋒部隊將領。在猇亭之戰中率部突入吳軍陣地，多次擊退吳軍反撲，展現卓越勇武。夷陵之戰劉備慘敗，陸遜火攻連營。傅彤臨危受命，率殘部斷后阻擊追兵，在烈火中死戰不退。身被數創，仍大呼酣戰，為劉備撤退贏得寶貴時間。吳軍勸降時，傅彤厲聲斥責：“吳狗！何有漢將軍降者！” 最終力竭戰死。其子傅僉后來亦在蜀漢滅亡時于關城殉國。","en":"A mid-period general of Shu Han. Fu Tong followed Liu Bei into Shu early on and earned numerous merits during the pacification of Yi Province, gradually rising through the ranks to become a mid-level officer. In the 2nd year of Zhangwu (222), Fu Tong accompanied Liu Bei on his eastern expedition against Sun Wu, serving as a vanguard commander. At the Battle of Xiaoting, he led his troops in charges against Wu positions and repelled multiple counterattacks, displaying outstanding valor. When Liu Bei suffered a devastating defeat at the Battle of Yiling and Lu Xun's fire attack consumed the linked encampments, Fu Tong received the critical mission of commanding the rear guard to block pursuing forces, fighting to the death amid the flames. Though wounded multiple times, he continued to fight with great fury, buying precious time for Liu Bei's retreat. When Wu soldiers urged him to surrender, Fu Tong thundered defiantly: ‘Dogs of Wu! Since when does a Han general surrender!’ He ultimately fought until exhausted and died in battle. His son Fu Qian later also gave his life defending Guancheng when Shu Han fell.","jp":"蜀漢中期の将。傅彤は早くから劉備に従って入蜀し、益州平定において度重なる軍功を挙げ、次第に中堅の将校へと昇進した。章武二年（222年）、劉備の孫呉への東征に従い、先鋒部隊の将を務めた。猇亭の戦いでは部隊を率いて呉軍の陣地に突入し、幾度も呉軍の反撃を退け、卓越した武勇を示した。夷陵の戦いで劉備が惨敗し、陸遜が連営に火攻めを仕掛けた際、傅彤は危急に際して命を受け、残兵を率いて殿を務めて追撃を阻み、猛火の中で死戦して退かなかった。幾重にも傷を負いながらも大呼して奮戦を続け、劉備が撤退するための貴重な時間を稼いだ。呉軍が降伏を勧告すると、傅彤は「呉狗め！漢の将軍に降る者などいるものか！」と声を荒らげて叱責し、最後は力尽きて戦死した。その子である傅僉もまた、後に蜀漢の滅亡に際して関城で殉国した。","kr":"촉한 중기의 장수. 부동은 젊은 시절 유비를 따라 촉으로 들어갔으며, 익주 평정 과정에서 수차례 전공을 세워 점차 중급 군관으로 승진했다. 장무 2년(222년), 부동은 손오를 동정하는 유비를 수행하여 선봉 부대의 장수를 맡았다. 효정 전투에서 부대를 이끌고 오군 진지에 돌입해 오군의 반격을 여러 차례 격퇴하며 탁월한 용맹을 떨쳤다. 이릉 전투에서 유비가 참패하고 육손이 화공으로 영채를 불태우자, 부동은 위기 속에 명을 받들어 잔여 부대를 이끌고 후위를 맡아 추격군을 저지하며 맹렬한 불길 속에서도 물러서지 않고 결사항전을 벌였다. 온몸에 수많은 상처를 입고도 크게 고함치며 용맹하게 싸워 유비가 퇴각할 수 있는 귀중한 시간을 벌어주었다. 오군이 투항을 권유하자, 부동은 '오나라 개 같은 놈들아! 한나라 장군 중에 어찌 항복하는 자가 있겠느냐!'라고 호통치며 결국 힘이 다해 전사했다. 그의 아들 부첨 또한 훗날 촉한이 멸망할 때 관성에서 순국했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10636","remark":"","surname":"傅","surnameTc":"傅","surnameEn":"Fu","surnameJp":"傅","surnameKr":"부","surnameOther":"","name":"彤","nameTc":"彤","nameEn":"Tong","nameJp":"彤","nameKr":"동","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"傅彤","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"207","city":"CS1035","gender":"0","rule":"72","force":"80","wise":"56","politics":"42","charm":"78","will":"89","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"72/34/34/34/34/17/50/34","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1003102;1018102","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1006005","warSoul":"S1002805","battleSoul":"1012205","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4300","battleSoulPoint":"5100","debateSoulPoint":"3100","strategy":"1013715","strategy2":"1007201","professions":"4/3/1/0/0/0/1/0/1/1/1/2/1/0/3/0/0/3/0/1/0/0/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"7","compatible":"49","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2700","evaluate":"4000","title":"","rank":"